    <title>Constrained Decoding for Cross-lingual Label Projection</title>
    <summary>
      We study constrained decoding methods for cross-lingual label projection.
      Our approach leverages structured prediction constraints to ensure valid
      output sequences while maintaining high accuracy across languages.
    </summary>
